{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"CLOSED (regression; caused_by fd4a). Durable fix landed.\n\n- Gerrit change 2454 MERGED as commit 627faccae8df on main.\n  - LLM-Review +1 (SATISFIED) and Verified +1 (SATISFIED) on PS3.\n  - PS2's blocking finding (timestamp-based \"immediately-previous\" selection with a second-granularity CreatedAt sort + random-sha tiebreak) is resolved: the rollback target is now identified by RECORDED DEPLOY ORDER (`$STATE_DIR/mcp-previous-sha`, written at cutover with the OUTGOING live sha), not by a build timestamp. Reconcile preserves exactly {live, recorded-previous}, and FAILS SAFE (removes nothing) when the live image is unidentifiable OR when no previous release has been recorded yet.\n  - 2 residual LLM-Review comments on PS3 are advisory `(tests)` coverage nits (guard-4 daemon-refusal backstop; the cutover same-sha guard). Non-blocking: submit_requirements showed No-Unresolved-Comments = NOT_APPLICABLE, unresolved_comment_count = 0. Left as fast-follow rather than churn the +1.\n\n- Root disk stays healthy post-merge: CloudWatch `rebar-root-disk-pressure` = OK (latest datapoint 77%, below the 85% threshold). LLM-Review is unblocked (2454 itself earned LLM-Review +1), confirming the fail-closed deadlock is cleared.\n\n- Part A (one-time reclaim) remains as attested above (14 orphan compose-mcp:<sha> images removed; 76%->62%; alarm ALARM->OK). Part B now prevents recurrence in code.\n\nNote on completion verification: the first close attempt failed because the MCP server's completion verifier inspected the main checkout's working tree (which had not fast-forwarded to the merged commit); re-running with `--ref 627faccae8df` (the merged tree) verified GREEN and signed the close."},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788149526821967733,"uuid":"dbe0b1cd-ee87-4572-9bd4-7919bece96fb"}